====Usage notes====
* In general use, {{m|de||Türkisch}} refers to the varieties spoken in Turkey, including at mots the closely related varieties in countries neighbouring Turkey (such as [[Bulgaria]] or [[Syria]]).
* In linguistic and other scientific use, {{m|de||Türkisch}} usually refers to the above only when the context is clear, while {{m|de|Türkeitürkisch|lit=Turkey Turkish}} is used for clarity.

